  "collectionNotes": [
    "Manufacturer guide explicitly names Factory bin and factory demonstration.",
    "Exact source URLs, fetch identity, hashes and source-specific deviations preserved. No firmware bodies mirrored.",
    "Eight TCA9554 relay coil controls are observable, but contact loads, current ratings, isolation and analog switching are unmodeled.",
